repository-code: 'https://github.com/er7-rust/er7-rust/'
url: 'https://er7-rust.github.io/'
abstract: >-
  ER7 Rust is a Cargo workspace holding three independently versioned and
  published Rust crates for working with HL7 v2 messages in the ER7
  pipe-hat encoding: er7 parses, queries, edits, and writes ER7 messages
  with zero runtime dependencies; er7-redact removes patient detail from a
  message without changing its shape; and serde-er7 serializes and
  deserializes ER7 message trees with Serde. Each crate is developed
  spec-first, with every behavioural rule numbered in its own
  specification and bound to the test that enforces it.
keywords:
  - HL7
